// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// ModBuilder Sample Project: CustomIcons & Hotkeys
// Data/English/Generals.str
//
// Localized tooltip string definitions with hotkey indicators in square brackets.
// This allows players to see hotkeys both in the tooltip and on the control bar.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

CONTROLBAR:ToolTipAmericaVehicleCrusaderHotkey
"Construct Crusader Tank [Q]\nMedium battle tank equipped with a 105mm high-velocity cannon. Can be upgraded with Composite Armor and Battle Drone."
End

CONTROLBAR:ToolTipAmericaVehiclePaladinHotkey
"Construct Paladin Tank [W]\nAdvanced battle tank equipped with a point-defense laser system that shoots down incoming missiles and mortars."
End

CONTROLBAR:ToolTipGLAInfantryWorkerHotkey
"Recruit Worker [Q]\nConstructs and repairs GLA structures and collects supplies."
End

CONTROLBAR:ToolTipChinaInfantryTankHunterHotkey
"Train Tank Hunter [W]\nAnti-vehicle infantry armed with rocket launchers. Capable of TNT attacks against buildings."
End
